:"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1719723/47562088-0592-4f22-9d27-4b8d92f3356e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1719723/47562088-0592-4f22-9d27-4b8d92f3356e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1719723/47562088-0592-4f22-9d27-4b8d92f3356e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Spacious 5-room apartment with a private garden and terrace in Schönefeld, just minutes from BER Airport. Ideal for families, the apartment features 4 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, a separate kitchen, and access to a communal garden area. Perfectly situated for professionals, relocating families, and frequent travelers seeking a comfortable and well-connected home just outside Berlin.\n\n\nHow is the commute from here to other locations?\nThe following public transport stops are nearby:\n• Bus: Schönefeld, Theodor-Fontane-Allee (~1–5 min walk; lines 741, 742, 744)\n• S-Bahn: S Schönefeld (bei Berlin) (~15–20 min walk; lines S9, S85)\n• U-Bahn: Rudow (U7) (~35–40 min walk)\n• Close to Berlin Brandenburg Airport (BER) via S9 and local buses.\n\nDoes it have parking space?\nYes, the apartment includes 1 underground parking space.\n\nHow big is the apartment?\nThe apartment has approximately 131 sqm of living space. It features a 176 sqm private garden, access to a communal garden, and comes with a basement cellar and underground parking.\n\nHow many rooms does the apartment have?\nIt’s a 5-room apartment: 4 bedrooms, 1 living room, plus a separate kitchen and utility room. Suitable for families.\n\nWhy Choose this apartment?\nSchönefeld offers a quieter, greener residential environment compared to central Berlin, while remaining extremely well-connected — making it the ideal choice for families who want space and nature without sacrificing access to the city.\nWith 4 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms across a generous layout, the apartment comfortably accommodates larger families or households, offering everyone their own private space — a rare find at this scale in the Berlin-Brandenburg region.\nThe proximity to BER Airport — one of Europe's major travel hubs — means international travel, business trips, and arrivals are virtually effortless, saving considerable time and cost compared to living further into the city.\nThe combination of a private garden, terrace, communal garden, and a separate kitchen makes this apartment exceptionally liveable for day-to-day family life, offering the kind of comfort and functionality that is genuinely hard to find in a single rental property.\n\nWhat's cool about the apartment?\nThe apartment offers an impressive 5 rooms including 4 separate bedrooms, making it one of the most spacious family rental options available in the Schönefeld area — ideal for families, remote-working households, or those simply needing extra room.\nA private terrace and personal garden come with the apartment, offering a wonderful outdoor retreat for children to play, families to gather, or individuals to relax — complemented further by access to a shared communal garden area.\nThe separate kitchen provides a dedicated cooking space entirely apart from the living areas, a practical and much-appreciated feature for family life that is increasingly rare in modern apartment layouts.\nThe location directly next to BER Berlin Brandenburg Airport is a standout advantage — frequent flyers and international professionals can reach the terminal in just minutes, while S-Bahn lines S9 and S45 connect the area swiftly to Berlin city center and beyond.\n\nOverview\nWelcome to this generously sized family-friendly 5-room apartment in Schönefeld, Brandenburg, offering the perfect blend of space, comfort, and outstanding connectivity. The apartment features 4 private bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, a separate kitchen, a private terrace, and its own garden — a rare combination that provides ample room for families to live, work, and unwind. Residents also benefit from access to a communal garden area, adding further green space to enjoy. The location is exceptional — Schönefeld sits directly adjacent to BER Berlin Brandenburg Airport, making it ideal for frequent travelers and international professionals. Despite its proximity to the airport, the neighborhood retains a calm and residential character with good transport links into Berlin city center. This apartment is a truly unique opportunity for families or larger households looking for space, nature, and seamless access to both Berlin and the wider region.\n\n\nAmenities & Furniture:\nShared Garden, Cellar, Private Garden, Commission Free, Storage Room, Wooden floor, Utility room, Terrace, Apartment Heating, Underground Parking, Ground Floor, New Construction, Shower\n\n1) The contract can start on any date, and the rent will be calculated on a daily pro-rata basis.\n2) Our contract charges are calculated on a daily pro-rata basis. This means your rent will be based only on the exact number of days from your move-in date.\n3) Once the booking is confirmed and all documents are received, we  will send you a rental contract via email and You need to sign it & send it back to me within 48hours.\n4) Registration possible and the necessary document will be provided post the move-in\n5) The check in can only take place Monday to Friday 9 am until 6 pm. Check in on the weekends or national holidays would be possible upon request for a small fee of 100€\n6) Liability insurance is required for your stay and that needs to be submitted to us within 15 days from your move in date.. We recommend you to search for one yourself with a keyword “Haftpflichtversicherung“\n7) Final cleaning fee: 470 €\n8) 7% Surcharge is applicable for short-lets (duration of less than 6 months)\n9) For rental durations of more than six months, the deposit can be paid in three installments.\n10) Seurity deposit amount needs to be paid before the move-in date\n","facilities":{"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"no"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"no"},"bedrooms":{"value":"4"},"cleaningCommonRoomsIncluded":{"value":"no"},"cleaningPrivateRoomIncluded":{"value":"no"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"no"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"131"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"no"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"no"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":280000,"deposit":735000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"2800.00","deposit":"7350.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":3,"moveInWindow":14,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-06-27"}],"updated":"2026-06-27T00:08:32Z","__utId__":"ut1719723"},{"id":"1701366","rank":15,"rating":0,"published":"2026-04-17","kind":1,"kindLabel":"entire place","type":3,"typeLabel":"apartment","rentType":"monthly","title":"Lützowstraße, Berlin","cancellationPolicy":"strict","marketType":"rental_company","originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.com/room/ut1701366/de/Berlin/l-tzowstra-e?utm_medium=affiliate&utm_source=Stayforall&affiliate_partne